OL,3,GNEWSATeen sentenced for string of
OL,4,A'reckless' arson attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 19-year-old man has been jailed after
OL,7,Fa string of arson attacks that caused
OL,8,Fan estimated #150,000 worth of damage.
OL,10,FPrzemek Trojecki, who pleaded guilty to
OL,11,Fnine offences, started fires in
OL,12,FFishponds and Stapleton in Bristol last
OL,13,Fyear, damaging cars and homes, one of
OL,14,Fwhich was so severe the family had to
OL,15,Fmove out.
OL,17,FTrojecki, from Fishponds, was sentenced
OL,18,Fto five years and three months in a
OL,19,Fyoung offenders institution during a
OL,20,Fhearing at Bristol Crown Court on
OL,21,FTuesday.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
