OL,3,GNEWSATeen sentenced for string of
OL,4,A'reckless' arson attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Trojecki's actions were reckless and
OL,7,Fcould easily have caused serious
OL,8,Finjury," said DS Jeremy Cowburn, adding
OL,9,Fthat the fires left people fearful,
OL,10,F"which is totally unacceptable".
